    <!--
      Reminder texts (title + text), a different one each day so they don't get boring.
      "daily": the usual ones. "streak": the player's streak is at stake (%d = days in a row, at least 2).
      "comeback": the app hasn't been opened for 3 days or more. Keep them short and friendly;
      the emojis are part of the text (only ones that Android 7 can show).
    -->
